    /// Sample output: 0.3.0-nightly+3cb96bde9b.1737036656.debug
    /// Note: Build timestamps may vary slightly across platforms due to separate CI jobs.
    /// For reliable version comparisons, use UNIX format (e.g., >= 1700000000)
